Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}Paraiso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}独轮车
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,912)}就像杂技一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,912)}它就这么被取了名字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}脆弱的现实什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}谁需要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.21,0:00:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}只要沉迷其中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.97,0:00:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,912)}不就没问题了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,912)}真是个无比美好的容身之处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,916)}至少，像廉价的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}这种东西要是守着不放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.07,0:01:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,923)}心可是会碎掉，扭曲成奇怪的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,929)}这种事也是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}啊——净想着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,926)}开心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,923)}反正没有光也没有出口
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,923)}那就永远在这回不去的马戏团里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}尽情享受就好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.41,0:01:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,919)}这是哪儿啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}VR
