Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,920)}该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(721,929)}靠！
